to match this in decorations &amp;amp; such. I do not want a coral over load, and of course I hate its complimentry color (aqua,teal, any shade of blue for that matter) Any ideas?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I do not know what color flowers or what kind would go with the dresses or chair sashes for the ceremony, i&#039;m lost&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;d love help :) lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"SP12Mid_BridalPartyLP_top_color1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/842831\/width\/600\/height\/310\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1623884,"PostDate":1337889852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My ladies will be wearing David Bridals Coral Reef color dresses, but I for the life of me can not figure out how to match this in decorations & such. I do not want a coral over load, and of course I hate its complimentry color (aqua,teal, any shade of blue for that matter) Any ideas?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I do not know what color flowers or what kind would go with the dresses or chair sashes for the ceremony, i'm lost<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'd love help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"SP12Mid_BridalPartyLP_top_color1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/842831\/width\/600\/height\/310\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sometimeinoctober@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.73.199.69","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1334691437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254151.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":260,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shes2013","Id":254151,"Name":"shes2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67731,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"362d69c2e0e549922a9392368c61566a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I did coral and aqua, but since you&#039;re not a shade of blue fan, I would votee coral, gray (silver) and yellow.&amp;nbsp;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1623891,"PostDate":1337890619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I did coral and aqua, but since you're not a shade of blue fan, I would votee coral, gray (silver) and yellow.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruzziwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.224.172.7","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1310437977,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242223.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cdc150","Id":242223,"Name":"cdc