awContent":"Congrats \nAlso planning for April 2016 giving guests time to save","Attachments":[],"Id":1850924,"PostDate":1400349200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats <br \/>Also planning for April 2016 giving guests time to save\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdevries@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359755444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kardev","Id":265520,"Name":"Kardev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d8cb88eae10768ec5f96c4cd6951dd6","RawContent":"Feb 2016 here! We are planning ahead to allow our guests to save as well! Looks like there are a few of us doing the same thing! In the meantime it allows me to try and save some money by keeping my eye out for deals... Try DIY projects and find the perfect dress all without feeling the panic! We have our resort 99% confirmed (going down for a site visit in 3 weeks to make sure it&#039;s perfect)... And then invites are going out in July to allow early deposits. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1850927,"PostDate":1400349645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Feb 2016 here! We are planning ahead to allow our guests to save as well! Looks like there are a few of us doing the same thing! In the meantime it allows me to try and save some money by keeping my eye out for deals... Try DIY projects and find the perfect dress all without feeling the panic! We have our resort 99% confirmed (going down for a site visit in 3 weeks to make sure it's perfect)... And then invites are going out in July to allow early deposits. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390235008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48f8eb5b413321f493bafa8803dd2771","RawContent":"Congrats everyone","Attachments":[],"Id":1850997,"PostDate":1400397364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats everyone\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdevries@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"50.65.17.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359755444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265520.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kardev","Id":265520,"Name":"Kardev","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.233.153.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1e1fe5027fa5d64e7f3aee82115b610","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;2016 bride here!!! I am so happy I stumbled across this site, I have already encountered things I have not previously. Late January\/Early February of 2016 seems to be our set time frame.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has any 2016 bride booked yet? Or just searching for the best hotels\/resorts?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1866362,"PostDate":1408015082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>2016 bride here!!! I am so happy I stumbled across this site, I have already encountered things I have not previously. Late January\/Early February of 2016 seems to be our set time frame.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has any 2016 bride booked yet? Or just searching for the best hotels\/resorts?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>The Future Mrs. Santos\u00a0<\/b>","Email":"tljubainville@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.233.153.252","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408003616,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279435.jpg?_r=1409501389","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Tiffany1221","Id":279435,"Name":"Tiffany1221","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.27.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1408015902,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"641a66f14301c36b3e4295a0697e11f4","RawContent":"We are booked and photographer, reception\/ceremony sites are reserved and 3\/4 of our guests have booked and paid. Expecting around 70-80 people so the early planning got us a great rate for our guests! (Invited 120)","Attachments":[],"Id":1866368,"PostDate":1408015886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are booked and photographer, reception\/ceremony sites are reserved and 3\/4 of our guests have booked and paid. Expecting around 70-80 people so the early planning got us a great rate for our guests! (Invited 120) \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390235008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.233.153.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86e128352a2623ee530d4d02b39672e8","RawContent":"Wow thats a lot of people already @[member=\"kmk2016\"]! I&#039;m waiting for air fare dates to be posted before i send STDs so your much more prepared than me","Attachments":[],"Id":1867337,"PostDate":1408281128,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow thats a lot of people already @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a>! I'm waiting for air fare dates to be posted before i send STDs so your much more prep