,"JoinDate":1413934446,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.252.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfb58aef83c4948161a6bd88c7b90b5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;2016 here!! =) Congrats and welcome! I am sure you will find a ton of useful stuff here.. Enjoy and see you around!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876516,"PostDate":1413954780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>2016 here!! =) Congrats and welcome! I am sure you will find a ton of useful stuff here.. Enjoy and see you around!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411386487,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.47.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75627,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"288a5e01fcc32c3a07963d2cb526eadb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Brides of 2016..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to all of you and welcome to the community.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Excitement is running through these posts,you can feel it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If any of you lovelies are planning a Mexican DW or any beach &amp;nbsp;DW,&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;we would like to invite you to read our article \"Top Tips for WOW beach wedding Photos\" you can find it on the home page of the forum or by using the below link.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226\" title=\"\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_242467.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_242467.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_449954.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_449954.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17832\/sml_gallery_277385_17832_211110.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17832_211110.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_35397.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_35397.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17835\/sml_gallery_277385_17835_99547.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17835_99547.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17792\/sml_gallery_277385_17792_2336606.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17792_2336606.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Any questions about Mexico for a wedding destination,dont hesitate to contact us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Happy early planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Alexis&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876572,"PostDate":1413972038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Brides of 2016..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations to all of you and welcome to the community.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Excitement is running through these posts,you can feel it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If any of you lovelies are planning a Mexican DW or any beach \u00a0DW,<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">we would like to invite you to read our article \"Top Tips for WOW beach wedding Photos\" you can find it on the home page of the forum or by using the below link.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/wedding-tips\/top-tips-for-wow-beach-wedding-photos-by-vincen-r2226' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...by-vincen-r2226<\/a><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_242467.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_242467.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_449954.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_449954.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17832\/sml_gallery_277385_17832_211110.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17832_211110.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17854\/sml_gallery_277385_17854_35397.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17854_35397.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17835\/sml_gallery_277385_17835_99547.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17835_99547.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17792\/sml_gallery_277385_17792_2336606.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_277385_17792_2336606.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Any questions about Mexico for a wedding destination,dont hesitate to contact us.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Happy early planning!!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Alexis<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"georgina@pixanphoto.com","IpAddress":"201.166.29.36","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1398710202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277766.jpg?_r=1411686578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PixanPhotography","Id":277766,"Name":"PixanPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":90,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
